{"id":24295,"author":"Tqniz","body":"Dear Staff/mods on Avicus\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eSo i did an appeal for like 2-3 weeks but i dont think i posted\u0026nbsp;it on the forums so\u0026nbsp;i am trying again to\u0026nbsp;appeal.\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003e\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eAbout\u0026nbsp;6 months i think,i got banned for\u0026nbsp;using hacks. And i will admit that is true.\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eBut i want to make an apology for hacking on Your server.\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eI am so sorry for hacking on Your server it really doesnt help me because it just punish you.\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eI used wurst and then in the middle of a game i got in ts With a mod called Jiveh. I did a screenshare and he found out.\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eHe said i could appeal in a couple of months and now i am back 6 months later.\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eFrom now on i have deleted the hacks and will never use them again in my life either if i use them on hypixel,mineplex or on Avicus.\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eI am so sorry still for hacking and as i said i will never use it again. If you could unban me i would really like that. Not because i like playing on Your server, buy i also have an rank i bought (Emerald rank).\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eI hope you Accept my appeal i feel really sorry for doing this.\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003e","body_tagged":"Dear Staff/mods on Avicus\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eSo i did an appeal for like 2-3 weeks but i dont think i posted\u0026nbsp;it on the forums so\u0026nbsp;i am trying again to\u0026nbsp;appeal.\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003e\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eAbout\u0026nbsp;6 months i think,i got banned for\u0026nbsp;using hacks. And i will admit that is true.\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eBut i want to make an apology for hacking on Your server.\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eI am so sorry for hacking on Your server it really doesnt help me because it just punish you.\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eI used wurst and then in the middle of a game i got in ts With a mod called Jiveh. I did a screenshare and he found out.\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eHe said i could appeal in a couple of months and now i am back 6 months later.\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eFrom now on i have deleted the hacks and will never use them again in my life either if i use them on hypixel,mineplex or on Avicus.\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eI am so sorry still for hacking and as i said i will never use it again. If you could unban me i would really like that. Not because i like playing on Your server, buy i also have an rank i bought (Emerald rank).\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003eI hope you Accept my appeal i feel really sorry for doing this.\u003cbr id=\"null\"\u003e","created_at":1473092130,"title":"Ban  Appeal","replies":[{"id":333058,"author":"faht","body":"\u003cb\u003eRefer to what I said 2 weeks ago;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"row-fluid\" style=\"width: 869.984px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"span1\" style=\"float: left; min-height: 1px; margin-left: 0px; width: 52.0469px; box-sizing: border-box; padding-top: 3px; margin-right: 5px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/Jiveh\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none;\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\"round-mini\" src=\"https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/498a6bc49ae5ddd139b8214dc2c8a9e9?s=45\u0026amp;default=mm\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: auto; height: auto; vertical-align: middle; border: 0px; border-radius: 3px; margin: 0px 1px;\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"span11 no-margin\" style=\"float: left; min-height: 1px; margin-left: 0px; width: 795.625px; box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 0px !important;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/Jiveh\" style=\"color: rgb(212, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;\"\u003eJiveh\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cdiv class=\"online\" data-original-ti